# Context diet

- Skills: load **index** (name/description/parent) into prompts; activate bodies only via `/skill`, inline `/name`, or explicit activation. Cap oversized bodies.
- MCP: send **catalog stubs** to the model by default; use `mcp_list` / `mcp_schema` for full JSON Schema. Do not reintroduce “all schemas every turn”.
- Root `AGENTS.md` is a **router**. Put deep guidance in nearest package `AGENTS.md` or an activated skill — never grow a mega-doc.
- Prefer hierarchical skills (`parent.child`) over a flat dump of dozens of peers.
